WEBVTT

00:00:06.790 --> 00:00:09.000
S-still not yet, Chino...?

00:00:09.630 --> 00:00:11.960
I'm waiting for a good opportunity.

00:00:12.290 --> 00:00:15.380
They'll run away before I can pet them
if I approach too carelessly.

00:00:16.670 --> 00:00:17.420
Now!

00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:25.830
O-oh I'm so sorry, Syaro!

00:00:28.380 --> 00:00:30.710
The rabbits didn't run away...

00:00:41.080 --> 00:00:44.210
The rabbits didn't run away! 
The rabbits didn't run away!

00:00:45.250 --> 00:00:46.460
Am I dreaming?

00:00:46.960 --> 00:00:49.080
I'm jealous...!

00:00:49.540 --> 00:00:51.750
This is the first time 
I've managed to hug one!

00:00:51.880 --> 00:00:54.170
I think this all happened
because I was together with you, Syar-

00:00:56.040 --> 00:00:58.130
P-please hang on a moment!

00:00:59.960 --> 00:01:01.040
Thank you...

00:01:01.830 --> 00:01:03.130
Pardon me.

00:01:03.130 --> 00:01:03.750
Huh?

00:01:06.830 --> 00:01:10.790
Somebody save me...!

00:01:12.130 --> 00:01:15.960
Spin around with a twirl, hey, dance dance

00:01:15.960 --> 00:01:19.000
In the heavenly cafeteria, dance dance

00:01:19.250 --> 00:01:21.540
Where is the door? (Over here!)

00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:25.040
Take a hop into the cup (Leap right in!)

00:01:25.460 --> 00:01:28.630
Big puffy clouds float through the sky

00:01:28.630 --> 00:01:31.750
They actually taste sweet, 
for real (Just kidding!)

00:01:31.750 --> 00:01:34.790
If we fly through the sky 
in tea cups and coffee cups

00:01:34.790 --> 00:01:37.790
We can go anywhere together

00:01:38.210 --> 00:01:44.540
Wanting to be a dreamer forever 
(More impossible than possible)

00:01:44.540 --> 00:01:50.210
Think about how exciting tomorrow 
will be (So many flavors to try!)

00:01:50.420 --> 00:01:52.790
Cinnamon instead of sugar

00:01:52.790 --> 00:01:56.830
If that becomes a preference, 
it might be time for evolution

00:01:56.830 --> 00:02:00.080
Going to a new place (Were you invited?)

00:02:00.080 --> 00:02:02.830
If you get invited there, 
let's take the plunge and fly

00:02:02.830 --> 00:02:06.000
(C'mon ride in the tea cup 
and soar through the sky)

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:08.290
(C'mon ride in the coffee cup, yeah yeah)

00:02:08.500 --> 00:02:12.130
Spin around with a twirl, hey, 
dance dance (Dance dance!)

00:02:12.130 --> 00:02:15.330
In the heavenly cafeteria, 
dance dance (Dance dance)

00:02:15.330 --> 00:02:18.830
Where is the door? It's inside of the cup

00:02:19.040 --> 00:02:21.380
An illusion? Or reality? Which?

00:02:21.580 --> 00:02:24.580
It doesn't really matter 
either way (Good point)

00:02:24.580 --> 00:02:27.880
A dollop of whip cream on 
your head (Fluff fluff)

00:02:27.880 --> 00:02:33.830
Okay, just dance (The future) it'll 
definitely be fun (So let's fly!)

00:02:34.210 --> 00:02:37.330
Flying through the sky in 
tea cups and coffee cups

00:02:37.330 --> 00:02:40.080
We can go anywhere together!

00:02:46.830 --> 00:02:50.130
Is it just me, or have a lot of girls around here
changed their looks?

00:02:50.290 --> 00:02:55.000
The photo shoot for the graduation album
is coming up, so everyone's trying to look hip!

00:02:55.630 --> 00:02:57.000
Graduation...

00:02:57.670 --> 00:02:59.880
How about we do the same?

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:01.960
Just for that one lousy day?

00:03:01.960 --> 00:03:03.580
No way!

00:03:03.580 --> 00:03:04.880
I wholeheartedly agree.

00:03:09.250 --> 00:03:11.420
Always keeping it natural!

00:03:11.420 --> 00:03:13.130
That's the Chimame Corps way!

00:03:13.880 --> 00:03:17.750
In that moment, none of us 
had the slightest inkling...

00:03:18.500 --> 00:03:22.210
that a traitor would soon 
appear within our ranks.

00:03:25.420 --> 00:03:30.330
I know we agreed to "keep it natural,"
but I at least want to get my bangs cut.

00:03:30.630 --> 00:03:33.170
And it would be nice to smooth 
out my frizzy hair a bit.

00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:38.330
Oh, I know! I'll ask Syaro for some advice!

00:03:39.000 --> 00:03:41.710
My hair is pretty similar to hers.

00:03:42.000 --> 00:03:46.080
So maybe she knows a good stylist
or treatment I can use!

00:03:50.790 --> 00:03:52.460
What do you want this time?

00:03:52.670 --> 00:03:53.630
The usual.

00:03:54.040 --> 00:03:55.250
An at-home haircut?!

00:03:55.920 --> 00:03:57.330
Here comes the water!

00:03:57.540 --> 00:03:58.330
It's cold!

00:03:58.630 --> 00:04:00.130
Don't turn your head.

00:04:01.920 --> 00:04:06.210
My hair has started looking like a bird nest
when I wake up in the mornings.

00:04:07.420 --> 00:04:09.170
Well, I'll comb that all out for you.

00:04:12.080 --> 00:04:15.290
The way Chiya cuts hair looks so gentle.

00:04:15.580 --> 00:04:18.330
And I just love the vibe she has going on.

00:04:22.460 --> 00:04:25.580
I wish I could have her cut 
my hair like that, too.

00:04:27.630 --> 00:04:28.380
Oh?

00:04:28.500 --> 00:04:29.460
Megu!

00:04:30.130 --> 00:04:31.580
H-hello!

00:04:32.210 --> 00:04:34.330
Do you want to join us, Megu?

00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:38.000
I also... um...

00:04:38.920 --> 00:04:41.790
Come on! Let's feel the fluff together!

00:04:41.790 --> 00:04:42.290
Huh?

00:04:42.290 --> 00:04:44.460
Don't take advantage of me when I can't move!

00:04:46.420 --> 00:04:50.130
So, you're not interested in 
the fluff, but the haircut?

00:04:50.830 --> 00:04:52.710
If you don't mind, Chiya.

00:04:53.130 --> 00:04:54.250
Leave it to me!

00:04:54.460 --> 00:04:57.080
Being able to do a haircut 
for a graduation shoot...

00:04:57.920 --> 00:05:01.670
that's a grand affair second 
to none at Salon de Chiya!

00:05:02.880 --> 00:05:04.000
Hold on a minute!

00:05:04.330 --> 00:05:06.710
I should be the one who cuts Megu's hair!

00:05:06.790 --> 00:05:07.420
Huh?

00:05:07.710 --> 00:05:09.500
Because if you do it, then...

00:05:09.750 --> 00:05:11.710
this is what'll happen to her bangs!

00:05:11.540 --> 00:05:12.250
STRAIGHT

00:05:12.630 --> 00:05:14.750
The same thing happens 
with your haircuts, Syaro!

00:05:14.380 --> 00:05:15.130
STRAIGHT

00:05:15.580 --> 00:05:18.790
Then, the one who groomed Wild Geese was...

00:05:19.080 --> 00:05:20.500
Both of us!

00:05:20.670 --> 00:05:21.500
STRAIGHT

00:05:20.670 --> 00:05:22.080
Such confidence!

00:05:22.830 --> 00:05:25.750
I'll make sure all your excessive bangs
get sent to their grave!

00:05:25.750 --> 00:05:27.880
What good is that gonna do?

00:05:28.000 --> 00:05:29.920
Enough, girls! No fighting!

00:05:30.330 --> 00:05:34.080
You just leave all those fussy 
waves of hair to little ol' me.

00:05:34.500 --> 00:05:35.880
Grandma!

00:05:38.880 --> 00:05:41.790
A messy bob cut might be good for you,
but that's no fun.

00:05:42.000 --> 00:05:45.540
Instead, how does the idea 
of a straight perm sound?

00:05:48.710 --> 00:05:52.630
Chiya, where's that thing 
we're always using on Anko?

00:05:53.040 --> 00:05:55.290
What's gonna happen to me...?

00:06:01.880 --> 00:06:03.500
Hair accessories, huh?

00:06:06.630 --> 00:06:09.750
There's not much I can do 
since my hair is so short.

00:06:10.830 --> 00:06:13.380
If I could at least fix 
my one antenna hair...

00:06:14.290 --> 00:06:16.790
Or maybe if I turned it into a big cowlick...

00:06:18.130 --> 00:06:20.330
Wh-what are you spying on me for?!

00:06:21.380 --> 00:06:23.000
So, you wanna change your look, huh?

00:06:23.630 --> 00:06:25.830
I mean, pictures are forever, you know?

00:06:26.170 --> 00:06:29.830
I want to do something about
this antenna hair of mine at the very least.

00:06:30.250 --> 00:06:32.830
Okay, I've got just the thing. Hold still.

00:06:39.130 --> 00:06:41.420
Does your hair have superpowers or what?!

00:06:42.380 --> 00:06:43.830
Fine.

00:06:44.290 --> 00:06:45.960
Then how about this!

00:06:49.290 --> 00:06:52.460
Nope, no way! This is too showy!

00:06:54.460 --> 00:06:56.420
See? You're laughing at me again!

00:06:57.420 --> 00:07:00.210
Why does it look so good on you?!

00:07:00.920 --> 00:07:02.580
Did you try it on, too?

00:07:05.170 --> 00:07:07.420
Okay! Then I'll pick something out for you!

00:07:07.420 --> 00:07:07.920
Huh?

00:07:07.920 --> 00:07:09.710
No, I'll do it myself.

00:07:10.830 --> 00:07:12.830
This would look great on you, Rize!

00:07:15.330 --> 00:07:16.250
See?

00:07:16.250 --> 00:07:18.000
A-are you sure?

00:07:18.000 --> 00:07:20.250
I'm not good with this stuff.

00:07:20.460 --> 00:07:23.420
I'm telling you, a mature 
color like this is perfect.

00:07:24.330 --> 00:07:27.330
I'm jealous because it 
would never work on me.

00:07:27.670 --> 00:07:29.790
Wouldn't this look good on you, Maya?

00:07:30.630 --> 00:07:31.500
You think?

00:07:32.460 --> 00:07:34.420
Then, we'll be matching...

00:07:36.880 --> 00:07:41.630
You don't have to go so far as
to match your thoughts with mine!

00:07:39.880 --> 00:07:41.630
As if it's my fault!

00:07:41.750 --> 00:07:42.750
Numbskull.

00:07:47.330 --> 00:07:49.130
It's gotten a little long...

00:07:51.540 --> 00:07:55.790
I don't want my eyes to be covered
in the graduation picture.

00:07:58.210 --> 00:08:00.500
I'll just trim them myself, like usual.

00:08:04.790 --> 00:08:07.500
Well, what do you think?

00:08:07.710 --> 00:08:09.960
What's with your fur, Grandpa?

00:08:09.960 --> 00:08:12.210
Cocoa trimmed it for me!

00:08:12.210 --> 00:08:13.710
What?!

00:08:13.920 --> 00:08:18.580
Honestly, Cocoa always goes overboard.
I didn't want my fur to be this silky smooth.

00:08:18.920 --> 00:08:21.670
All I wanted was to get 
rid of the hairballs...

00:08:22.000 --> 00:08:23.540
The feel of it is incredible.

00:08:22.000 --> 00:08:26.500
With my hair cuticles this smooth,
it's gonna be hard not to slip all over the floor!

00:08:23.540 --> 00:08:26.500
She's made it more fluffy than ever before!

00:08:27.080 --> 00:08:29.710
Are haircuts are another one of her skills?

00:08:30.170 --> 00:08:32.500
No, she may only be able 
to do this with rabbits.

00:08:33.880 --> 00:08:35.330
I'm home!

00:08:36.670 --> 00:08:39.290
Please give my hair a good trimming, too!

00:08:41.710 --> 00:08:43.040
What?!

00:08:46.710 --> 00:08:49.040
Are you comfortable, miss?

00:08:49.040 --> 00:08:51.040
Why are you pretending this is a real salon?

00:08:51.040 --> 00:08:53.210
It's quite chilly out today.

00:08:53.210 --> 00:08:54.830
Here, have a blanket.

00:08:55.040 --> 00:08:56.580
Thank you.

00:08:57.790 --> 00:09:00.130
I'll leave a magazine for you right here.

00:08:58.960 --> 00:09:00.250
All the best autumn accessories
to complete your seasonal outfits

00:09:00.790 --> 00:09:03.170
Would you like a hot cup of coffee?

00:09:03.170 --> 00:09:05.710
I can serve you up some 
bread if you're hungry.

00:09:05.920 --> 00:09:07.710
Please just cut my hair.

00:09:07.710 --> 00:09:08.710
Of course!

00:09:13.880 --> 00:09:16.670
Doing this really makes it 
feel like we're family, huh?

00:09:17.000 --> 00:09:18.920
Are you done playing salon already?

00:09:20.630 --> 00:09:24.670
I was just reminded of how
I had my big sister cut my hair back home.

00:09:25.170 --> 00:09:28.170
Actually, your hair has also 
gotten pretty long lately.

00:09:29.250 --> 00:09:31.130
I've been letting it grow out.

00:09:31.540 --> 00:09:34.750
I'm trying to model myself 
after my sister a little.

00:09:39.830 --> 00:09:43.460
Just letting it grow out 
won't turn you into Mocha.

00:09:45.000 --> 00:09:50.040
I shouldn't disparage her. Cocoa's actually trying
to be more of an adult for once.

00:09:50.960 --> 00:09:52.960
What kind of cut would you like today?

00:09:53.250 --> 00:09:55.290
Do you want me to trim your split ends?

00:09:55.630 --> 00:09:58.830
I'm trusting that your skills
will make my hair look beautiful.

00:09:58.960 --> 00:10:00.880
So please cut it however you see fit.

00:10:01.330 --> 00:10:03.830
Huh?! What's with all the pressure?!

00:10:04.330 --> 00:10:06.630
Well, I'm glad I have your trust.

00:10:07.170 --> 00:10:08.920
It makes me so happy!

00:10:09.330 --> 00:10:11.710
Okay, little missy! Get 
ready for a real humdinger!

00:10:11.750 --> 00:10:13.170
Now you sound like you're 
from the last century!

00:10:13.460 --> 00:10:15.880
I swear I'll give you the most wonderful cut!

00:10:16.170 --> 00:10:18.250
Are you feeling nervous by chance?

00:10:18.250 --> 00:10:21.210
But if I screw up, then at least use
the squeaky hammer when you hit me!

00:10:21.210 --> 00:10:24.540
A plain old cut is fine, so 
please don't screw it up!

00:10:29.330 --> 00:10:34.130
So miss, I hear you decided to apply
to the same school that your elder sister attends?

00:10:34.670 --> 00:10:35.460
That's right.

00:10:37.380 --> 00:10:39.630
Then you'll take the same 
route as your big sister.

00:10:39.630 --> 00:10:41.380
Attend the same school.

00:10:41.540 --> 00:10:44.330
And work together in Rabbit House afterwards.

00:10:44.630 --> 00:10:47.710
Which means you'll be in the same place
at all times from morning till night!

00:10:47.960 --> 00:10:50.080
In that case, I'm picking a different school.

00:10:50.460 --> 00:10:51.000
Huh?!

00:10:57.920 --> 00:11:00.920
I should have known it was 
a bad time for a joke...

00:11:01.250 --> 00:11:03.630
As an apology, I'll let you cut my hair!

00:11:04.000 --> 00:11:06.250
I thought you were trying to grow it out?

00:11:07.250 --> 00:11:09.670
I'm still me all the same.

00:11:09.920 --> 00:11:13.540
Growing my hair out doesn't automatically
make me a big sister...

00:11:18.250 --> 00:11:21.540
Well, I actually quite 
like your usual hairstyle.

00:11:21.710 --> 00:11:22.380
Really?

00:11:27.330 --> 00:11:28.000
Oh?

00:11:29.500 --> 00:11:30.580
Going for a pair look?

00:11:30.580 --> 00:11:32.460
No, I just screwed up.

00:11:32.460 --> 00:11:35.880
That's not true! You did a great job, Chino!

00:11:35.880 --> 00:11:38.170
Yes. You both look wonderful.

00:11:44.500 --> 00:11:48.630
We said we were "keeping it natural,"
so how am I going to explain this?

00:11:48.880 --> 00:11:50.750
Chino! G'morning!

00:11:50.880 --> 00:11:52.080
Good morning.

00:11:52.290 --> 00:11:54.460
Good morni- huh?!

00:11:54.460 --> 00:11:55.920
What's with the new looks?!

00:11:56.080 --> 00:11:57.880
Th-that's confidential.

00:11:57.880 --> 00:11:59.580
It's a long story.

00:11:59.920 --> 00:12:01.830
You both look kind of mature.

00:12:01.830 --> 00:12:03.080
Y-you think so?

00:12:03.080 --> 00:12:05.250
The same goes for you, Chino!

00:12:05.250 --> 00:12:07.000
That look really suits you!

00:12:07.210 --> 00:12:10.170
M-my new look just kind 
of happened on accident.

00:12:11.250 --> 00:12:14.250
I figured that you two 
would go all out for today!

00:12:14.460 --> 00:12:16.920
Well, I didn't intend to 
take it quite this far...

00:12:16.920 --> 00:12:19.500
My bangs will grow back soon enough, anyway.

00:12:23.210 --> 00:12:25.960
You darn traitors!

00:12:28.210 --> 00:12:30.380
Come on down to Rabbit House's Bread Fest!

00:12:30.380 --> 00:12:32.130
It includes pasta!

00:12:31.960 --> 00:12:34.330
We're doing it again this year!
BREAD FEST
Buh-buh-buh-buh-Bread Fest~
I baked them!

00:12:32.330 --> 00:12:34.290
And also delicious coffee!

00:12:34.790 --> 00:12:37.130
Buh-buh-buh-buh-Bread Fest!

00:12:37.670 --> 00:12:38.790
Hi, Syaro!

00:12:39.040 --> 00:12:40.960
You're having another Bread Fest?

00:12:41.210 --> 00:12:43.670
We're satisfying everybody's autumn appetite
by making it all-you-can-eat!

00:12:44.130 --> 00:12:45.580
Do you think you can come this time?

00:12:46.000 --> 00:12:50.580
I'd sure like to. That melon bread
you gave me last time was yummy.

00:12:50.830 --> 00:12:55.380
U-um, my newest coffee blend
will also be available at this Bread F-

00:12:56.170 --> 00:12:58.210
A Bread Fest, eh?

00:12:59.040 --> 00:13:01.500
I'm planning to attend.

00:13:01.500 --> 00:13:03.330
She's peeking at me from down under again!

00:13:03.330 --> 00:13:05.380
Miss Aoyama!

00:13:05.380 --> 00:13:07.170
Your manuscript!

00:13:07.170 --> 00:13:08.420
It's Miss Rin!

00:13:08.580 --> 00:13:11.330
Join us for the Buh-buh-buh-buh-Bread Fest!

00:13:11.330 --> 00:13:12.750
Quit saying it like that!

00:13:13.170 --> 00:13:14.290
All-you-can-eat?

00:13:15.170 --> 00:13:17.830
Sounds nice, but only if I 
can fit into my schedule.

00:13:17.830 --> 00:13:20.710
You can catch Miss Aoyama
if you come to the Bread Fest!

00:13:20.830 --> 00:13:21.630
I'm in!

00:13:22.040 --> 00:13:23.880
Um, the coffee is also...

00:13:23.880 --> 00:13:25.920
Buh-buh-buh-buh-Bread Fest, was it?

00:13:26.170 --> 00:13:27.710
I'll be there without a doubt!

00:13:28.000 --> 00:13:29.710
It's going to be fun!

00:13:30.420 --> 00:13:31.290
When did she get over there?

00:13:31.290 --> 00:13:34.130
Sensei! Hold it!

00:13:34.130 --> 00:13:37.080
Buh-buh-buh-buh-Bread Fest!

00:13:34.880 --> 00:13:37.080
Are they really going to show up?

00:13:37.750 --> 00:13:39.670
Huh? Where did Chino go?

00:13:41.460 --> 00:13:42.330
Over there!

00:13:45.830 --> 00:13:47.290
Chino!

00:13:49.080 --> 00:13:51.250
She's turned rogue just like Wild Geese!

00:13:51.960 --> 00:13:55.290
Rabbit House ain't no bakery, ya dig?

00:13:55.540 --> 00:13:58.130
Everybody quit hating on coffee, ya dig?

00:13:58.330 --> 00:13:59.960
Chino's gone to the wild side?!

00:13:59.960 --> 00:14:01.210
She's a total delinquent!

00:14:01.830 --> 00:14:03.330
You gotta turn back to normal, ya dig?

00:14:03.330 --> 00:14:04.790
Is this a new ventriloquism routine?!

00:14:04.790 --> 00:14:06.130
Don't eat the grass!

00:14:07.040 --> 00:14:08.250
Well, well.

00:14:08.830 --> 00:14:10.460
What are you all doing here?

00:14:10.460 --> 00:14:11.500
It's terrible, Chiya!

00:14:11.500 --> 00:14:14.380
Wild Geese has totally possessed Chino!

00:14:14.380 --> 00:14:17.630
Then it's time for Anko to... ride on!

00:14:17.880 --> 00:14:19.790
Quit treating Chino like some kind of toy!

00:14:22.330 --> 00:14:24.420
Now her expression looks just like Anko's!

00:14:24.790 --> 00:14:26.670
Wow! She must be channeling his spirit!

00:14:26.880 --> 00:14:28.330
But Anko is still alive!

00:14:28.540 --> 00:14:30.750
Chino, come back!

00:14:34.250 --> 00:14:37.420
Sorry. I was just messing with you guys.

00:14:37.540 --> 00:14:38.920
Jeez!

00:14:38.920 --> 00:14:41.960
I seriously thought you were mad with us!

00:14:41.960 --> 00:14:43.750
You've gotten so mischievous.

00:14:44.290 --> 00:14:46.040
She's becoming more and more like Cocoa.

00:14:46.210 --> 00:14:48.290
I worry she'll be a handful in the future.

00:14:49.460 --> 00:14:50.130
Huh?

00:14:51.000 --> 00:14:55.000
Bunnisode 6:
A Fluffle of Rabbits is Also Most Welcome

00:15:03.500 --> 00:15:06.000
I really hope that customers will show up.

00:15:06.330 --> 00:15:08.210
It's strange to see you so uneasy.

00:15:08.500 --> 00:15:10.500
When I visited home recently...

00:15:11.130 --> 00:15:14.460
my lack of skills compared to my sister
was made crystal clear.

00:15:14.880 --> 00:15:18.420
Hearing you talk like that
is enough to make me start to worry!

00:15:18.630 --> 00:15:23.130
There's nothing to worry about because both
Cocoa's bread and your pasta are absolutely delicious.

00:15:23.380 --> 00:15:24.250
Chino!

00:15:24.460 --> 00:15:27.670
And together with your coffee,
we'll be the best cafe in town!

00:15:27.880 --> 00:15:30.290
You already missed your 
chance to encourage me.

00:15:30.710 --> 00:15:32.920
Huh? Are you still grumpy?

00:15:33.420 --> 00:15:35.460
I ain't grumpy, ya dig?

00:15:37.330 --> 00:15:39.710
We're here and we're hungry!

00:15:39.710 --> 00:15:42.170
We're gonna chow down on all the bread!

00:15:42.420 --> 00:15:44.540
Hey now, don't eat us out of house and home.

00:15:44.750 --> 00:15:47.750
Either Maya's stomach will 
get filled to max capacity,

00:15:48.000 --> 00:15:51.500
or my arms will wear out 
from kneading more bread.

00:15:51.750 --> 00:15:52.960
It'll be a contest!

00:15:53.420 --> 00:15:54.920
Sounds good to me!

00:15:55.540 --> 00:15:57.920
Please just see them to their seats...

00:16:00.500 --> 00:16:03.290
Ah, the bread smells so good!

00:16:03.460 --> 00:16:05.830
They've got both coarse and 
fine bean paste filling!

00:16:05.960 --> 00:16:07.380
Cocoa is really serious about this!

00:16:08.040 --> 00:16:09.960
What can I get for you?

00:16:10.250 --> 00:16:12.040
One melon bread and one croissant.

00:16:12.040 --> 00:16:14.290
And some coffee on the side.

00:16:14.460 --> 00:16:16.420
Are you sure you want 
to be drinking caffeine?

00:16:17.250 --> 00:16:19.630
I want to let loose for today.

00:16:20.920 --> 00:16:22.750
You make it sound like you're at a bar!

00:16:22.750 --> 00:16:25.040
I'd like a drink of my own!

00:16:26.710 --> 00:16:28.290
I'm going to have green tea.

00:16:28.290 --> 00:16:29.790
Be nice and order coffee!

00:16:29.920 --> 00:16:31.380
I want a mochaccino!

00:16:31.380 --> 00:16:32.830
Do your job, Cocoa!

00:16:34.290 --> 00:16:35.580
Thank you for waiting.

00:16:35.580 --> 00:16:37.580
This is like, super cute!

00:16:38.130 --> 00:16:40.210
It's our special blend coffee.

00:16:40.460 --> 00:16:42.920
There's a flower made 
of whipped cream on top!

00:16:42.920 --> 00:16:46.040
I came up with this blend 
especially for today.

00:16:46.330 --> 00:16:48.290
It almost feels like a waste to drink.

00:16:48.290 --> 00:16:50.330
Let's sip it nice and slow.

00:16:58.210 --> 00:17:01.790
Superb... what a wonderful fragrance...

00:17:02.290 --> 00:17:04.710
Here! Have a flower wreath, Syaro!

00:17:05.000 --> 00:17:06.830
Thanks for all you do.

00:17:07.250 --> 00:17:08.880
Syaro, put your hand out.

00:17:09.080 --> 00:17:09.830
My hand?

00:17:11.460 --> 00:17:14.290
La-la-la-la-la!

00:17:14.420 --> 00:17:18.000
Caffeine makes the world go round n' round!

00:17:18.210 --> 00:17:20.920
Let the caffeine take you on a journey!

00:17:20.920 --> 00:17:23.130
I feel such a nice warmth...

00:17:24.250 --> 00:17:26.920
This is... Heaven!

00:17:27.500 --> 00:17:29.580
What special ingredient did 
you put in that coffee?!

00:17:29.580 --> 00:17:31.500
Nothing more than my feelings!

00:17:31.710 --> 00:17:32.380
Excuse me!

00:17:33.460 --> 00:17:35.630
I'd like a special blend coffee also!

00:17:36.210 --> 00:17:38.420
I thought that you weren't a fan of coffee.

00:17:40.080 --> 00:17:42.330
W-well, Heaven sounds nice.

00:17:42.330 --> 00:17:44.380
Not everybody reacts like Syaro does!

00:17:45.250 --> 00:17:47.960
You certainly have the 
curiosity of an editor.

00:17:53.540 --> 00:17:54.460
It's delicious!

00:17:56.460 --> 00:17:59.210
The bitterness and acidity of 
the coffee itself is very mild.

00:17:59.210 --> 00:18:01.580
And the cream helps make 
it go down extra smooth!

00:18:01.960 --> 00:18:06.880
There are many people who have trouble with
or don't like coffee, so I made this for them.

00:18:07.290 --> 00:18:08.330
I see.

00:18:08.330 --> 00:18:10.420
So it's intentionally easy to drink.

00:18:11.130 --> 00:18:14.500
Well, I can really feel the 
warmth of your feelings.

00:18:15.130 --> 00:18:16.500
"Warmth"...

00:18:17.540 --> 00:18:19.710
Oh, thank you very much.

00:18:20.040 --> 00:18:21.710
All the work you put in is paying off!

00:18:22.040 --> 00:18:25.130
Let's put this special 
blend on the normal menu!

00:18:25.580 --> 00:18:28.630
That might be enough to make 
Miss Rin a regular here!

00:18:28.790 --> 00:18:29.540
Yes!

00:18:29.710 --> 00:18:33.210
With coffee like this, I'll be able to pull
all-nighters with Miss Aoyama easily!

00:18:34.170 --> 00:18:36.130
Good luck with that, Miss Aoyama!

00:18:38.330 --> 00:18:41.250
Mommy! I wanna drink the flower coffee, too!

00:18:41.500 --> 00:18:42.920
You're a little young for coffee.

00:18:43.210 --> 00:18:44.130
Excuse me.

00:18:44.790 --> 00:18:47.380
If you'd like, I'll make 
it a hot cocoa instead.

00:18:47.710 --> 00:18:50.420
Oh really? That would be wonderful.

00:18:50.540 --> 00:18:52.580
Will you show me how you 
make the flower on top?

00:18:52.750 --> 00:18:53.750
Of course.

00:18:56.460 --> 00:18:58.130
You're so talented!

00:18:58.290 --> 00:18:59.670
Thank you.

00:19:00.420 --> 00:19:02.330
Can you make things other than flowers?

00:19:02.500 --> 00:19:06.290
I think so. Maybe something 
like a fluffy rabbit.

00:19:06.670 --> 00:19:08.960
Fluffy rabbit? I wanna see!

00:19:09.380 --> 00:19:11.830
Chino looks like a big sister.

00:19:12.630 --> 00:19:14.290
She resembles you, that's for sure.

00:19:14.790 --> 00:19:19.500
I guess I don't need to change myself
if Chino already resembles me.

00:19:19.630 --> 00:19:20.290
Hm?

00:19:21.500 --> 00:19:22.630
Never mind!

00:19:23.040 --> 00:19:23.580
Huh?

00:19:23.880 --> 00:19:26.580
Oh, these must be the ones she messed up.

00:19:26.580 --> 00:19:28.080
I'll drink one.

00:19:30.830 --> 00:19:31.750
Huh?

00:19:33.880 --> 00:19:36.580
I can't tell the difference 
from our regular blend.

00:19:36.880 --> 00:19:40.880
You've never been able to distinguish
any type of coffee, Cocoa.

00:19:40.880 --> 00:19:41.790
That's not true!

00:19:42.130 --> 00:19:46.540
Because all the coffee that you make
has always been super yummy to me!

00:19:51.920 --> 00:19:52.880
Chino?

00:19:54.000 --> 00:19:57.920
It's nothing, I thought you were
just trying to be nice to me.

00:19:58.380 --> 00:20:00.880
Cocoa! Can I place an order with you?

00:20:01.580 --> 00:20:02.790
Sure, I'm coming!

00:20:07.710 --> 00:20:10.540
What's got you looking so happy, Chino?

00:20:10.710 --> 00:20:12.330
You've got a big smile on.

00:20:12.330 --> 00:20:13.830
No, I don't.

00:20:23.670 --> 00:20:25.960
Today's Bread Fest was a huge success!

00:20:25.960 --> 00:20:28.250
Yeah! It's all thanks to you two!

00:20:28.460 --> 00:20:30.500
This proves that we're 
the most supreme sisters!

00:20:30.500 --> 00:20:32.040
How does that work?

00:20:32.250 --> 00:20:34.290
Chino's coffee got rave reviews, too!

00:20:35.460 --> 00:20:38.460
The latte art was really 
popular with the kids.

00:20:38.460 --> 00:20:41.040
You were made to be a 
great big sister, Chino!

00:20:41.670 --> 00:20:44.460
A big sister... me?

00:20:46.040 --> 00:20:48.670
Yeah! You did great, big sis!

00:20:48.880 --> 00:20:50.250
Good girl, good girl!

00:20:50.250 --> 00:20:52.500
Q-quit poking fun at me!

00:20:52.630 --> 00:20:54.790
I'm going to take down the sign outside.

00:21:10.580 --> 00:21:14.830
Grandpa... do you think I've 
been able to change a little?

00:21:15.130 --> 00:21:16.500
I'd say so.

00:21:17.380 --> 00:21:19.380
What did they mean by "warmth"?

00:21:20.670 --> 00:21:24.210
All the rabbits still run away
when I approach them by myself...

00:21:27.670 --> 00:21:29.710
Chino, turn around.

00:21:29.710 --> 00:21:30.330
Huh?

00:21:53.670 --> 00:21:55.040
Welcome!

00:21:56.460 --> 00:21:58.250
We are friends forever!

00:21:58.420 --> 00:22:00.500
Friends! Okay! Friends!

00:22:00.500 --> 00:22:03.880
We'll make it happen! There's 
no problem since it's all okay!

00:22:03.880 --> 00:22:07.710
"There are mysterious things in this world"

00:22:07.710 --> 00:22:11.540
An inviting message from 
outside the familiar window

00:22:11.670 --> 00:22:15.420
Would you like to explore different places?

00:22:15.420 --> 00:22:19.130
Yeah, yeah, an adventure is 
needed every now and then

00:22:19.540 --> 00:22:23.250
And eventually on some street corner far away

00:22:23.420 --> 00:22:27.250
We'll get a craving to drink the usual coffee

00:22:27.250 --> 00:22:33.290
There are many things to realize 
if you just take a step back!

00:22:35.380 --> 00:22:36.960
Of course...

00:22:36.960 --> 00:22:40.710
Right now being together is 
best, together forever is best

00:22:40.710 --> 00:22:44.500
Even amidst the changing seasons

00:22:44.500 --> 00:22:48.460
I want to keep these feelings, 
I want to treasure everyone

00:22:48.460 --> 00:22:52.420
I'm glad to have a place that I love

00:22:52.580 --> 00:22:56.290
Right now being together is best, 
that's right, together is best

00:22:56.290 --> 00:22:59.920
Even if you go somewhere 
else, be sure to come back

00:22:59.920 --> 00:23:04.040
I think that feeling is understood

00:23:04.040 --> 00:23:07.540
Because, after all, I got 
to see everyone today

00:23:07.790 --> 00:23:13.750
Seeing them whenever I want 
means... we're friends!

00:23:15.830 --> 00:23:17.580
We are friends forever!

00:23:17.830 --> 00:23:19.330
Friends! Okay! Friends!

00:23:19.880 --> 00:23:23.460
We'll make it happen! There's 
no problem since it's okay!

00:23:27.500 --> 00:23:29.170
Silky...

00:23:29.420 --> 00:23:32.130
Silky smooth...

00:23:33.040 --> 00:23:36.040
Bunnisode 7: We Shall Dance with Ghosts 
Until Dawn on this Halloween Night!

00:23:33.460 --> 00:23:35.670
I'm super silky smooth!
